Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:07.34,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:13.04,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:25.14,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.74,0:00:30.96,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.50,0:00:36.70,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.70,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.26,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.70,0:01:05.70,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.00,0:01:12.02,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.04,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:33.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I suspect you realise this already,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.97,0:01:42.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but the citizens are accusing us of power abuse\Nfrom illegal use of the Interceptor device...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.27,0:01:47.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Additionally, the media has broadcasted a proclamation\Nshowing an assassination attempt on the General.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.07,0:01:51.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is a serious problem for\Nthe entire police organisation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:54.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's a very reasonable opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:02:00.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police force is heading\Nthis case with great caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:08.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, I would ask that you cooperate\Nwith the police, and not do anything hasty...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.97,0:02:14.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Again, don't go too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:17.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:22.15,Default,,600,0,500,,{\b1\i1}The \N Mockingbird\N  Sings{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:25.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Man, the Chief's late...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.59,0:02:26.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:28.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.91,0:02:34.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Looks like he got lectured good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:44.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did he give you a disheartening lecture?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.89,0:02:46.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Minister?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:51.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is merely a representative of the citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:57.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The problem lies with Police Headquarters, who despite having the\NSuperintendent-General's assassination proclaimed in full public view,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:03:01.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,are taking their time conducting a dragnet operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:04.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And, with all that going on,\Nwe're just going to watch it all happen on TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.79,0:03:09.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will have earn every\NYen we pay you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:22.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Regarding the "Laughing Man" who is suspected to\Nhave appeared last night, at the press conference...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:27.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to assume it was\Nthe Police Force's own doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:33.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, hey! Sure, that incident blew away any suspicion\Nof their illegal use of Interceptors,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.22,0:03:36.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but even so... isn't it a little\Nearly to be assuming that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.12,0:03:41.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, this isn't like you Chief,\Nso can you tell us why you're assuming this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.32,0:03:43.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay then. Togusa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.52,0:03:45.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:51.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nanao-A. The Special Investigation\NDivision of the Police Department
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.02,0:03:55.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,considered him to be the most\Nimportant witness to the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:03:58.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,hence marking him for the past 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.72,0:04:02.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Him? He looks like an ordinary worker to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.02,0:04:09.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Me too. I figured that the\N"Laughing Man" would be a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.92,0:04:14.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to the data from the "Special\NInvestigation Division", he is 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:18.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His father was a policeman,\Nand he had a normal childhood...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:25.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Once he was in college, he held a position on one of\Nthe Liberation of Mankind Fronts, "The Green Tower".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:28.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He, along with "The Brigands of Protest",\Nwho were extremist at that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:34.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,participated in an armed\Nstruggle and was arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:39.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, upon his release he hid his past,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:45.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and joined "SERANO Genomics Company" as an\Nagent programmer as if nothing had happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:51.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When his past was exposed the next year by an\Nanonymous report, he was fired immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:54.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Such a convenient past, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:05:03.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, the circumstantial evidence for the S.I.D., needed to\Nprosecute this man has been appearing out of nowhere recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:05:03.22,Default,,900,0,950,,S.I.D. = {\i1}Special Investigation Division{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:09.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The S.I.D. are thinking Nanao's motivation was his hatred\Nfor SERANO, and are keeping an eye on his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:14.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Once S.I.D. has the evidence to link him to the\Ngeneral's assassination attempt, they will arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:18.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've got to be kidding me! There is no way\Nthis guy could be the "Laughing Man" now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:21.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's purely innocent, but set up\Nto look as guilty as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:23.82,comment,,1000,0,950,,{\b1\i1}White and black are Japanese figures of speech, white meaning innocent and black meaning guilty.{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.02,0:05:23.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is what I think too,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:31.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, why is the S.I.D. chasing after a man who, with\Nvery little thought, can be figured out as a decoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There must be some kind of underground plot going on inside the\NPolice on the "Interceptor" case and on the "Laughing Man",
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.92,0:05:46.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And Yamaguchi met his end by sticking\Nhis nose in too deep... I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:49.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't have concrete proof either,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:51.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,however, I do believe that\Nthe truth will be exposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:56.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,if we seize both the "something" that is fooling the\NS.I.D., and Nanao-A, who is posing as the "Laughing Man".
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We must find out as much as we can about\Nthis "thing" before the deadline,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:01.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,, the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:05.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For all we know,\Na monster serpent might jump out on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.42,0:06:10.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou and Togusa will keep a watch on Nanao 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:12.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Alright. Don't screw up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:14.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, don't be leaving in the middle\Nof something because you're bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.82,0:06:16.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The rest of you, under the command of the Major,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.22,0:06:19.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,find out about the "thing" that fooled the S.I.D.\Nsearching through Nanao's personal history.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:21.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:23.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is there something wrong, Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:25.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:33.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.93,0:06:36.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Geez won't you guys ever give me a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's true that I went to the\Nsame university as he did,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.73,0:06:42.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and I participated in some\Nactivities with him as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.83,0:06:48.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, he's so much scarier than I\Nam, you couldn't compare us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.93,0:06:58.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is also very persistent. If he decided\Nto carry out a plan, he wouldn't turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:02.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't want to speak too much about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.53,0:07:10.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but back then, I don't think there was anyone\Nmore worldly-wise than he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:15.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you are asking whether or not\NNanao had a grudge against us...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.73,0:07:16.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He has all the reasons to have one...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.73,0:07:23.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why? Because the blue prints for the\Nmicro-machines used by "SERANO" were practically...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:26.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They were practically made by Nanao alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:30.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then they used his past\Nagainst him to kick him out so,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.53,0:07:33.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,all of the rights to the micro-machine\Nwould belong to the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.33,0:07:35.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It would be unusual not to be upset
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.13,0:07:38.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He didn't try and reclaim the rights\Nto the micro-machines in court?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:39.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Our lawyers are too powerful,\Nso he wouldn't stand a chance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:50.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But officer, to tell you the truth, I actually\Nfeel like helping Nanao through this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:55.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You cops sure are nosy aren't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.76,0:08:01.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm so fond of those memories that I feel\Nlike telling you all about it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:06.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Heh, back then, the Economic Yakuza\Nwere taken over by the Intellectuals...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:13.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This Nanao kid was a real genius and\Nhe spoke against authority and power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:20.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The last cop that came seemed to wonder\Nwhy Nanao tried to team up with the Yakuza
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:26.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The idea that socially provocative behaviour\Nequals left-wing is a century out of date!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:30.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is no right or left when it comes to making money!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:38.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm just checking, but is this\Nthe Nanao-A you're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:40.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah that's him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.82,0:08:43.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His hair's a bit receded though...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:45.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.02,0:08:50.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's amazing that the S.I.D. was able to acquire\Nall of this information from 6 year old data...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:54.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even though I narrowed it down to Level D\NClass, I still got 1023 files.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:09:00.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm looking through the data starting at E\NClass, but it will still take me quite a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:02.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:05.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, please don't mind me... I will be leaving now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:09.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Only 34 more hours until the deadline..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:13.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There has got to be some clues...\NFind something at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.93,0:09:15.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:20.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief, why don't you stop with that ridiculous search\Nand just try to get Nanao to spill some beans?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.13,0:09:23.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Section 9's specialities are roughing\Nthings up and using cyberbrain lines...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.73,0:09:27.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Low-key operations like canvassing\Nshould be left to the S.I.D. and their numbers...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.53,0:09:28.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't be so hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.73,0:09:34.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we make a mistake on the timing for Nanao's\Narrest, we might be the ones to be hanged...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:35.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How's our subject?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:40.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is just sending brief\Nmessages through the line...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:43.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm checking all of his messages as a\Nprecaution, but they were all spam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.97,0:09:48.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And, there aren't any viruses\Nin the messages sent...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:51.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well we don't mind waiting forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:54.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But... if we have to, we can use brute force.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.42,0:10:01.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.32,0:10:02.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not at all, please come anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.72,0:10:05.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey Ishikawa, where's Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:09.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She said something about doing some\Nsearch on her external memory bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.72,0:10:11.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but I haven't heard from her since...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:14.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is she thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.17,0:10:23.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wouldn't your office have that data?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.37,0:10:27.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, but I was out of the country\Nwhen the incident happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.97,0:10:30.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So I want to know the rumours...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.39,0:10:33.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Rumours... eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.69,0:10:36.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The information the police handed\Nus just doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.99,0:10:37.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:40.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wanted to hang out,\Nsince I haven't seen you in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:43.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry... I will make it up to you some other time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard Motoko was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.26,0:11:04.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The time is 7:20 A.M. on February 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:06.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's time for the Odekake Weather Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.36,0:11:06.66,comment,,1100,0,970,,{\i1\b1}Odekake = Weather Report for going out{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:09.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone, how is your commute to work going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:15.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today's weather won't be sunny, but fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.66,0:11:21.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, later in the afternoon micro-machines\Nwill be sprayed for the removal of CO2.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:25.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those who are concerned of their throat,\Nit is advised that you wear a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.12,0:11:29.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And by the way... does anyone remember...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.82,0:11:35.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today Feb. 3rd is exactly 100 days\Nbefore the International Exposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:41.91,Default,,0,200,520,,2024 International Exposition Japan \N \N \N \N 100 Days to the opening of the Exposition
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:39.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So for this morning's Ode-Ten,\Nwe have thought up a survey for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:39.42,comment,,1250,0,900,,{\b1}Ode-Ten \N=\N Odekake Weather Report{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Titled... BanPaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.32,0:11:44.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}That's not fair!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.75,0:11:51.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, please tell everyone the\Ntruth in front of this camera...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:54.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop it! You can't shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:56.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:08.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If your promise from earlier was real, then right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:10.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:12.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why don't you tell them yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.64,0:12:17.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There will be no point! Mr. SERANO I want\NYOU to deliver the truth to the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.54,0:12:20.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I can't... do that
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.52,0:12:22.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:40.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,February 3, 2024, despite it happening 2 days earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:44.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the kidnapping of Mr. SERANO was\Nunpublished due to news censorship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:49.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A case in which even the Investigative authorities\Nhave failed to find even a single clue,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:52.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,has ironically exposed itself to the\Nmedia and made a rapid development.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.57,0:12:59.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The case of "The Laughing Man" was\Nthe beginning of Theatre-type crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:04.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to the investigation data\Nthen, threats were made
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:08.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,by using the voices of those around Mr. Earnest\Nwho were cyberbrain hacked, before the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.17,0:13:14.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We must conclude that this kidnapping occurred\Nbecause officials took the situation too lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.27,0:13:19.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Immediately after Mr. SERANO was cyberbrain\Nhacked and kidnapped out of his home,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:25.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,a massive ransom of 10 billion yen in cash and\N100kg of gold bullion was demanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:27.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, the connection between\Nthe kidnappers was terminated,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:30.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and until they appeared in\Nfront of the TV two days later
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.07,0:13:34.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the police was unable to determine\NMr. Serano's whereabouts...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.57,0:13:39.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The "Laughing Man" who threatened Mr. SERANO\Nin the midst of a live broadcast
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:44.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,had been hacking the camera's AI, the crowd,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.27,0:13:48.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and even the staff of the TV Station,\Nin real time with the mark...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:57.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After the incident, while he was running\Naway from the police in public, nobody
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.17,0:14:02.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,except the two homeless men who\Nhad no cyberbrains, saw his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:07.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In truth, the story that those who\Nclaim to have seen the culprit's face,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:13.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,had drawn the mark of the "Laughing Man"\Nwhile making a montage, is very famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:17.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And the clash of the\Nshocking incident and the pop culture mark,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:21.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,was popular among many young\Nmen, and subculture critics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:27.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The incident closely resembles the\NProclamation of the General’s Assassination...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.57,0:14:32.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If he did this all alone...\Nhe must be a super A class hacker...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:38.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But an old-fashioned physical kidnapping\Ndoesn't suit a hacker of that calibre...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.58,0:14:56.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After his shocking appearance,\Nhe avoided showing himself to the public...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.98,0:15:02.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He then continued to threaten Mr. SERANO\Nby saying he would input a deadly virus
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:04.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,into the production line of micro-machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:09.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Once the production of the micro-machines\Nfor medical treatment stopped,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:11.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and stock of the SERANO company declined,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:16.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the threats to Mr. SERANO died down,\Nas if it was the Laughing Man's main purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.88,0:15:23.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By using the same strategy, he then\Nthreatened 6 other micro-machine companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:29.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It appeared as if his primary objective was to threaten\Ncompanies, and was showing a new development...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:31.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That had continued for 3 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:37.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's his real objective?\NIs he alone? His race? His age?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.98,0:15:40.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What was hidden behind all\Nof the actions he has taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.98,0:15:47.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Once the public funds went to the damaged enterprises,\Nleaving investigators with many loose ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.78,0:15:51.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The "Laughing Man" disappeared\Ninto the dark on the net...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:16:00.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What I don't get is why he risked showing himself in\Nfront of the camera, to make Mr. SERANO say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:06.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In his message, his perspective\Nchanged from first person, to third---
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:09.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what he is calling a "desired delusion".
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.97,0:16:12.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This case isn't as simple as it may look...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.67,0:16:18.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think that the "Laughing Man" is something\Nthat emerged from the dark side of the net...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:24.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He is just made up by a group of people on the\Nnet who don't have any connection to each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.87,0:16:29.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thus this crime was a stand alone complex...\NAlso, a "Laughing Man" doesn't really exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:56.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief! I'm going to get off the Nanao\Ncase, and pass me Pazu and Saitou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:58.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you plan to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:17:00.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going to escort the General.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:02.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not that I don't believe in your deduction...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:05.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's just that I feel like one\Npiece of the puzzle is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:10.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's why I want to keep an eye on the General.\NSomething is whispering to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.89,0:17:12.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:22.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Very well. We've never had anything\Ncalled "team play" to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:26.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If anything, we only have teamwork\Nborn from individual play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:27.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.95,0:17:31.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't forget about Saitou and Pazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.42,0:17:39.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys hear that? We're going to\Nhave Saitou and Pazu back up the Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:40.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Go ahead, help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:45.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The interrogations are over so\NBoma and I can handle the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Boma...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.81,0:17:53.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Mobilise the AI girls, and get permission from the\NMinistry of Science to use the Hecatoncheires system.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:56.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're going to check one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.41,0:17:57.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.21,0:18:00.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's me... How's Nanao?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing out of the ordinary...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.51,0:18:05.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's just periodically sending out emails\Nlike he has been...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:18.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes...? Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.65,0:18:22.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Huh? about "that" case?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.85,0:18:27.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it had a larger influence than we expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:32.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was, one of the plans that we were preparing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.07,0:18:36.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:38.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, now if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:45.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Heh... I wasn't the one that made the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:48.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh well, I only have a little more work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.97,0:19:13.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! The General has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:18.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Would you like one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:20.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:33.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Routine report: The Superintendent-General has\Nentered. Everyone stand by at your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou, how's Nanao doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:41.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's just sending short messages as always...\NBut no sign of viruses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.60,0:19:42.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.60,0:19:49.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major! We've tapped into the S.I.D.'s conversation,\Nand they seem to be under a lot of pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.90,0:19:52.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why aren't we making a move?\NHe's right in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:57.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's regrettable is that we couldn't establish\Nsurveillance on Nanao,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,at the exact time the Superintendent-General's\Nassassination threat was made.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But that's the responsibility of\Nyou, Head Quarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Because we were too busy with\Nthe interceptor case, we were...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:06.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Chief! How's it going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:09.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.26,0:20:12.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The evidence that S.I.D. gathered on the\Ndates of the crimes of the "Laughing Man",
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:18.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,is reason enough to think Nanao is the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, there were some conflicting points\Nmade by those who were acquainted with Nanao,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:30.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so I examined the 43 files and found that\Nevery one of them seem to praise Nanao.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.16,0:20:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,These may be the doing of a\NCompulsary Recognition Program.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.66,0:20:39.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The depiction of Nanao in those testimonies doesn't form a\Ncohesive identity, but is synthesized from several personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:44.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Despite that, the contents of the testimonies themselves\Nare structured as a first-person narrative,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:54.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Despite that, all of the witnesses identified\Nthese pictures of Nanao, as Nanao-A himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.55,0:21:00.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It could be said that this data was made...\Nor rather... was over-written.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:03.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even the Cyber-Police wouldn't be able to\Nsee through these falsified memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:06.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,These changes in memory are so skillfully done,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.05,0:21:10.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that the S.I.D. couldn't even\Ndetermine them as fake memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:15.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good work! Batou! Capture Nanao immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.15,0:21:15.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,ROGER!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:19.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This case goes deeper than we thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:25.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Saitou, Pazu! Do you pick up noise on our connection\Nfrom the radio wave barrier, the police made?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.85,0:21:27.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nope! It's clearer than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.25,0:21:27.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Same with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:29.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:32.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Routine report: All personnel, shift your\Nalert status from Level B to C.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.77,0:21:42.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H-Hey where do you guys think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:43.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Public Safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.37,0:21:47.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H-Hey don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.24,0:21:55.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nanao-A! We're taking you in for questioning\Nregarding the assassination threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.84,0:21:59.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, why is Public Safety...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:21:59.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.12,0:22:08.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,W-What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:09.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What's going on!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.92,0:22:15.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,AHA HA HA HA! I was never there to begin with...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.04,0:22:22.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now I will be able to mark my name\Nin history as the "Laughing Man".
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:25.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.55,0:22:30.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is... It's an INTERCEPTOR!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:34.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The noise during the routine report\Nwas a fragmented latent virus...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.95,0:22:36.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's been watching through\Nthe S.I.D.'s eye all along...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.95,0:22:40.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou! Nanao's been sending fragments\Nof a virus through that system!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.25,0:22:43.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then I'll just trace him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.81,0:22:50.85,comment,,0,1100,825,,TRANSMIT
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.15,0:23:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.13,0:23:27.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.44,0:23:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:39.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.53,0:23:42.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:47.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.35,0:23:50.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.04,0:23:54.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.44,0:23:59.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.64,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.34,0:24:02.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.74,0:24:04.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:07.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.31,0:24:10.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.62,0:24:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
